################################
###########  FILES  ############
################################
*.pptx
*.DS_Store
*.tar.gz
.!*

# Interactive Plotly figures, written only on request (generate_plots.sh
# --plotly). Each embeds a full copy of plotly.js (about 5 MB) and is fully
# regenerable from the committed CSVs. They stay local; the PNG/PDF twins are
# what the READMEs display.
**/simulation_results/plots/*.html

# Resume caches of the Monte Carlo demos: finished grid cells of an interrupted
# run. A demo removes its cache once all results are written.
**/simulation_results/cache/

# Memory-mapped backing files of the ml_methods demos (up to 320 GB). The demos
# remove them on exit; an aborted run leaves one behind in the demo folder.
trex_mlm_demo_*_mmap.bin

